Region	Plaza	17	20	37	32
Region	Undercroft	21	34	33	42
Region	Court	40	34	54	41
Region	Hall	41	44	52	50
Region	EastRoad	44	24	52	34
[Trigger]
Name	firstFrost
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Master, Coldwell drinks from one old well, and the springs say something lies beneath it. The warden keeps his keep shut tight.
Action	objective	1	Slay Warden Hugo Cole in the keep hall.
Action	objective	1	Reach the well plaza and find the gold below it.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	plazaReached
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Plaza
Action	message	1	Here is the well. The rock south of it glints: that is gold, a whole block of it.
Action	reveal	1	Undercroft
Action	objective	1	Dig out 600 gold from the block under the plaza.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	wellEmptied
Mode	once
Cond	mined	1	>=	600
Action	message	1	The block is yours. Now you can afford a proper army.
Action	reveal	1	Court
Action	objective	1	Break the north gate of the keep.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	townHeld
Mode	once
Cond	claimed	1	Plaza	45
Action	message	1	The plaza is claimed. His watch is thin now.
Action	reveal	1	EastRoad
Action	setflag	townHeld	1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	courtBreached
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Court
Action	message	1	The keep has sounded its horn. Guards are running from the hall.
Action	reveal	1	Hall
Action	spawn	3	46	42	1	Knight:2	Adventurer:2	Adventurer:2
Action	setflag	keepAlarmed	1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	firstDrill
Mode	once
Cond	time	420
Action	message	1	A drill of townsfolk is marching up from the south road.
Action	spawn	3	30	46	1	Adventurer:2	Adventurer:2	Monk:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	secondDrill
Mode	once
Cond	time	900
Action	message	1	More watchmen are coming from the east road, and they carry shields.
Action	spawn	3	48	30	1	Knight:2	Adventurer:2	Monk:2	Adventurer:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	thirdDrill
Mode	once
Cond	time	1500
Action	message	1	Hugo Cole has emptied his barracks. This is everything he has.
Action	spawn	3	49	8	1	Knight:3	Knight:2	Adventurer:3	Monk:2	Adventurer:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	wardenSlain
Mode	once
Cond	time	5
Cond	creatures	2	<=	0
Action	message	1	Warden Cole is dead and the gates stand open. Coldwell is yours.
Action	win	1
[/Trigger]
[/Triggers]
